{"question": "Đánh giá năng lực xử trí chấn thương răng miệng của sinh viên y khoa quan trọng thế nào?", "claim": "Đánh giá năng lực xử trí chấn thương răng miệng ở sinh viên y khoa giúp nâng cao chất lượng chăm sóc răng miệng ban đầu.", "internal_evidence": [{"evidence_id": "I1", "content": "Sổ tay thực hành lâm sàng ghi nhận việc đánh giá năng lực xử trí chấn thương răng miệng ở sinh viên khối ngành sức khỏe là vô cùng cần thiết. Đề tài tập trung phân tích mức độ hiểu biết lý thuyết, khả năng ra quyết định điều trị cấp cứu và các yếu tố tác động từ môi trường đào tạo y khoa nhằm nâng cao chất lượng chăm sóc răng miệng ban đầu cho cộng đồng."}], "public_quote_options": [{"quote_id": "P1.Q1", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Oral leukoplakia (OL) is defined as a white patch or plaque of the oral mucosa that cannot be scraped off and cannot be classified as any other known disease entity [1,2]. The etiology of OL is multifactorial and primarily includes tobacco smoking and alcohol consumption, as well as chronic local irritation, inadequate oral hygiene, Candida spp. and HPV infections, nutritional deficiencies, and certain hereditary disorders [3,4,5,6]. Owing to its potential for malignant transformation, OL requires particular diagnostic and therapeutic vigilance."}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q1", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Table 3\nBaseline characteristics of study participants. SD, standard deviation; LB, liposomal bupivacaine; SB, standard bupivacaine\n| Control (Placebo) | 57 (safety population) | 20.9 (±4.8) | 24 (43.6%) | 53 (93.0%) | 1 (1.8%) | 3 (5.3%)"}, {"quote_id": "P3.Q1", "evidence_id": "P3", "text": "This study aims to assess the knowledge of fourth-, fifth-, and sixth-year medical students regarding the emergency management of TDI, with particular focus on tooth avulsion, tooth fracture stabilization, and appropriate first-aid protocols. By identifying gaps in training, the research aims to support the inclusion of structured dental trauma education in medical curriculum, thereby improving patient care in emergency settings. Additionally, the study evaluates the accuracy of students’ clinical decisions in hypothetical dental-injury scenarios and examines factors influencing their performance, including theoretical knowledge, prior personal experience with oral injuries, and educational attitudes."}, {"quote_id": "P4.Q1", "evidence_id": "P4", "text": "Participants were high risk in 22 estimates (78.6%); index test was high risk in 5 (17.9%); and target condition was high risk in 6 (21.4%). Overall applicability concern was high in 17 estimates (60.7%), low in 8 (28.6%), and based on insufficient information in 3 (10.7%). Detailed judgments are in Supplementary Files S2 and S4."}], "public_sources": [{"evidence_id": "P1", "title": "Efficacy of 5-ALA Photodynamic Therapy in Dysplastic Oral Leukoplakia: Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis", "heading_path": ["Body", "1. Introduction"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Efficacy of Liposomal Bupivacaine in Third Molar Extraction: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis", "heading_path": ["Body", "Review"]}, {"evidence_id": "P3", "title": "Factors influencing the accuracy of clinical decision-making in dental trauma: knowledge, experience, and educational attitudes among medical students", "heading_path": ["Body", "Introduction"]}, {"evidence_id": "P4", "title": "Diagnostic Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence for Dental Caries Detection Across Clinical Imaging Modalities: A Systematic Review and Descriptive Synthesis", "heading_path": ["Body", "3. Results", "3.2. Risk of Bias"]}], "conversation": [{"role": "user", "content": "Đánh giá năng lực xử trí chấn thương răng miệng của sinh viên y khoa quan trọng thế nào?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Việc này chắc chỉ mang tính hình thức chứ không giúp ích gì cho chăm sóc ban đầu đúng không?"}]}
